================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
================================================================================

This project is a small compatibility layer. It contains no source code copied
from the mods it bridges; see CREDITS.md for what was referenced and on what
terms. The dependencies below are NOT redistributed with this project (they are
either compile-only artifacts or separately installed mods), and each remains
under its own license. Users are responsible for complying with them.

  Yes Steve Model / OpenYSM / ModernYSM .... MIT
      https://github.com/OpenYSM
      Consulted at compile time and read for interface behaviour (class names,
      member descriptors, controller semantics). No source copied.

  ysm_epicfight_compat ..................... MIT
      Copyright (c) 2026 HSZK2017
      One technique was ported from it: resolving a target mod's classes from
      the mod loader's scan data rather than by hardcoded name
      (this project's YsmClasses). The port is credited in that file's javadoc.

  Scorched Guns 2 .......................... GNU GPLv3
      https://github.com/ribs-scorched-guns
      Interoperated with through reflection only. Not linked against at runtime
      beyond the ordinary mod-loader relationship, and no source copied.

  Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ) ........ see its own license
      Consulted for the IGun / GunTabType interface shape that YSM's gun
      pipeline expects. No source copied.

  Touhou Little Maid ....................... MIT (code) / CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (assets)
      https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid
      Reference only, for how a maid-side TACZ compatibility layer is
      structured. No source copied.

  Minecraft Forge .......................... GNU LGPL 2.1
      https://github.com/MinecraftForge/MinecraftForge

  Minecraft ................................ Mojang / Microsoft
      Not affiliated with or endorsed by Mojang or Microsoft.
